This directory includes parametric realizations of the unified Kalyna block cipher and Kupyna hash function inside the kalyna_kupyna.v file. The Kalyna implementation realizes both encryption and decryption functions under all possible block sizes and key lengths.
The Kupyna implementation realizes the hash function under all possible code lengths. They are based on the serial architecture, which executes one 64-bit operation at a time.
For the tapeout, the following block is considered, where the reset signal is assumed to be active low and  asynchronous.

Architecture    Module Name                       Mode                              Description
------------    ----------------------------      ---------------------             --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Serial          kalyna_kupyna_serial64b_oboc      Encryption/Decryption and Hash    Serial with one 64-bit operation in one clock cycle                                                       
